---
description: Twig templates (bundle views and demo templates)
globs:
  - "templates/**/*.twig"
  - "src/**/Resources/views/**/*.twig"
  - "demo/**/templates/**/*.twig"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer:
- small, backward-compatible template changes
- preserving current block structure (hosts override `@NowoSeoKitBundle` templates)
- Symfony Form rendering (`form_start` / `form_row` / `form_end`) instead of raw `<form>` / `<input>` markup (REQ-TWIG-005)
- reusing existing classes, ids, and hooks

This bundle ships no public JS/CSS assets (`make assets` is a no-op); do not add a `src/Resources/public` tree for a local change.
Do not rewrite entire templates for a local change.
